    {
      "id": "same-species-event-max",
      "conclusion": "同种宝可梦同时受多个活动的异色出现加成时，只采用效果最大的奖励；不相加。",
      "operation": "max",
      "quote": "If there are multiple bonuses from different events that increase your chance of encountering Shiny Pokémon and apply to the same Pokémon, the bonus with the largest effect will be applied.",
      "sources": [
        {
          "kind": "official",
          "url": "https://www.pokemonsleep.net/en/news/343330313733363436353339393830383039/"
        },
        {
          "kind": "official",
          "url": "https://www.pokemonsleep.net/zh/news/343537333337383034343630393136373338/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "expert-event-stack",
      "conclusion": "EX模式异色奖励可以与正在举办的活动异色奖励叠加；官方未公开加法、乘法、绝对概率或其他计算公式。",
      "stacks": true,
      "arithmetic": null,
      "quote": "The bonus that gives you an increased chance of encountering Shiny Pokémon in expert mode stacks with similar bonuses from ongoing events, further increasing your chances to encounter them.",
      "sources": [
        {
          "kind": "official",
          "url": "https://www.pokemonsleep.net/en/news/323932383138363132393037393333363937/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "befriending-badges-species",
      "conclusion": "友情徽章按宝可梦物种提高异色出现机会；铜/银/金徽章均有相关描述。与活动或EX的叠加方式和确切概率未公开。",
